  "summary": "With over a decade of experience in web development, e-commerce platforms, and system optimization, I have worked on a wide range of projects, from platform migrations to custom backend solutions that enhance efficiency and user experience. My expertise spans Magento 1.x & 2.x, Python/Django, AWS, cloud technologies, and DevOps, enabling me to build and maintain high-performance systems.\n\n\n\nI enjoy collaborating with product owners and stakeholders to develop effective solutions that align with business goals while ensuring technical feasibility.\n\n\n\nEarly in my career, I gained managerial experience leading development teams, overseeing technical operations, and mentoring engineers. This experience has helped me bridge the gap between technical execution and strategic planning, ensuring development efforts drive meaningful impact.\n\n\n\nPassionate about problem-solving, scaling infrastructure, and refining workflows, I continuously seek to expand my expertise in AWS, cloud solutions, and DevOps practices.\n\n\n\nSkills & Technologies\n\nLanguages & Frameworks: Python (3+ years), Django (3+ years), PHP (10+ years), Magento 1.x & 2.x (8+ years), JavaScript, jQuery\n\n\n\nWeb Technologies: Adobe Analytics, Adobe Data Collection Tags (formerly Adobe Launch, Adobe DTM), Google Analytics, New Relic, Cloudflare\n\n\n\nDatabases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, DynamoDB, Redis\n\n\n\nAWS (2+ years): Lambda, S3, SQS, RDS, EC2, CloudWatch, Serverless Framework\n\n\n\nDevOps & CI/CD: GitLab CI/CD, Jenkins\n\n\n\nProject Management & Collaboration: Jira, Taiga, Airtable\n\n\n\nInfrastructure & Performance Optimization: Caching, CDN, Query Optimization, Performance Monitoring\n\nAI tools:  Claude Code, Cursor",
